{
 "_about": [
  "The order a player is likely to meet scenes in, where the scripts leave it open.",
  "Inside one visit the game rarely forces an order - townspeople can be talked to in any",
  "sequence - so the sheet falls back to file order. This file records what someone who",
  "has played it knows: each entry in 'sequences' is a list of scenes that should appear",
  "in that order, and a range like '03YSK01A #9-#19' stands for those scenes in numeric",
  "order. translator_context.causal_pass adds them as soft needs: a scene listed later",
  "moves down to just after the one before it, and nothing else moves. A causal need",
  "always wins - an entry that contradicts one is reported and ignored, never applied.",
  "Scene labels are the Scene column of the context workbook."
 ],
